[36m(TaskRunner pid=331456)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=331456)[0m Summing these, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=331456)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=331456)[0m 1 + 81 = 82
[36m(TaskRunner pid=331456)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=331456)[0m 
